[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12962.71, "timestamp": "03:36:02", "text": "我的意思是，我应该算是成年人了吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12964.389, "timestamp": "03:36:04", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12968.15, "timestamp": "03:36:08", "text": "我不知道。我不知道。是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12971.99, "timestamp": "03:36:11", "text": "我想，大概是个心智幼稚的成年人吧。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12979.03, "timestamp": "03:36:19", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12982.309, "timestamp": "03:36:22", "text": "不过，我可以透露一点线索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12985.91, "timestamp": "03:36:25", "text": "提示一下模型。该模型是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12988.95, "timestamp": "03:36:28", "text": "描绘现在的我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12991.99, "timestamp": "03:36:31", "text": "那就是我。它也描绘了很多内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12994.15, "timestamp": "03:36:34", "text": "秘密的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12997.51, "timestamp": "03:36:37", "text": "它展现了我独特的性格特征"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12999.19, "timestamp": "03:36:39", "text": "那是我的声音，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13002.07, "timestamp": "03:36:42", "text": "很多人对此感到困惑，我可以给出一个提示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13003.83, "timestamp": "03:36:43", "text": "给你的就是外观将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13011.349, "timestamp": "03:36:51", "text": "但是，嗯，尽可能多地……嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13014.87, "timestamp": "03:36:54", "text": "集思广益，写点同人小说，你想写什么都行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13016.79, "timestamp": "03:36:56", "text": "这或许就是它仍然保留的概念。"}]